OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 50 new homes to be built
OL,4,Aacross two sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey council has approved a "much
OL,7,Fneeded" affordable housing project to
OL,8,Fbuild 48 homes which will be allocated
OL,9,Fto some of the 1,000 plus families on
OL,10,Fthe waiting list.
OL,12,FThe #14million project approved by
OL,13,FWaverley Borough Council (WBC) will see
OL,14,Fhomes built at Waverley Gardens in
OL,15,FFarnham, and at Farnham Oaks in
OL,16,FWrecclesham Hill.
OL,18,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,19,FReporting Service, the #300,000 cost
OL,20,Fper home has raised questions about the
OL,21,Fhigher costs of a similar housing
OL,22,Fproject in Godalming.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
