OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 50 new homes to be built
OL,4,Aacross two sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FJane Austin, leader of the Conservative
OL,7,Fgroup at WBC, said the project planned
OL,8,Ffor 69 High Street in Godalming is an
OL,9,F"outrageously poor investment".
